{"id":"wb-6-962","name":"陈化成墓","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"陈化成墓","text":"陈化成墓位于中国福建省厦门市思明区梧村街道金榜山社区金榜山北麓，现为第六批全国重点文物保护单位之一。该墓坐西北朝东南，墓区面阔23.5米，进深29.1米，占地面积683.85平方米。墓冢、墓围以砖石混合构建，外抹灰浆，平面呈“风”字形布局。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%99%88%E5%8C%96%E6%88%90%E5%A2%93","revisionId":92718519,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92718519","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/e29598df9a56134a00f4b356.jpg","title":"Chen_Huacheng_-_DSCF9885.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Chen_Huacheng_-_DSCF9885.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f9/Chen_Huacheng_-_DSCF9885.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"User:Vmenkov","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​陈化成之墓","width":320,"height":240}}